==Strategy==
This stage is relatively simple. Use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] cats like [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] or [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bath Cat]] along with a few [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] ([[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Boogie Cat]]) to deal good damage and beat the stage. As usual, [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] both work amazingly here, with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] also being a fairly solid choice.

